  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Port of Abidjan Truck Parking and Logistics Center Feasibility Study and Pilot Project, through NTELX, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study and pilot project that supports the Ministry of Transport&apos;s intent to expand and improve truck and freight movement around the Port of Abidjan in Cote d&apos;Ivoire through the implementation of a long-term truck parking and logistics public private partnership. The study and pilot project is assessing the viability of ICT solutions in truck control and management systems at the Port of Abidjan.</narrative>
  </description>
